      "body": "## Motivation\n\nFollow-up to the review comment on sgl-project/sglang#46124: keep the multimodal_gen KV caches in one place, `runtime/layers/kvcache/`, next to `causal_attention_cache.py` and `qvg_packed_cache.py`.\n\n## Modifications\n\n- Move `runtime/models/dits/nomas_kv_cache.py` to `runtime/layers/kvcache/nomas_segment_cache.py` unchanged (pure rename).\n- Update its three importers: `models/dits/nomas.py`, `test/unit/test_nomas.py` and `test/unit/test_nomas_realtime.py`.\n\nNo behavior change.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nNomas unit tests on 2×H200 (`test_nomas.py`, `test_nomas_realtime.py`, `test_nomas_parallel.py`): 52 passed.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:white_check_mark: [Run #40189832618](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40189832618)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #40189832502](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40189832502)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #40189832493](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40189832493)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
